{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And Pharaoh drew near</b> Three times in the Masorah: ופרעה הקריב · ופרעה חלם · כאשר כבדו אתכם מצרים ופרעה וגו' · הלא כאשר התעולל בהם. Meaning: even though Pharaoh dreamed and Joseph interpreted his dreams for him, he did not remember this kindness for him, and Pharaoh drew near to wage war against Israel — therefore התעולל בהם." "<b>Drew near</b> Twice in the Masorah: ופרעה הקריב · הקריב את קרבנו. When he came before Ba'al Zefon, he brought a sacrifice to it:" "<b>And behold, Egypt journeying after them</b> This is Uza, the prince of Egypt. Therefore they said: עזי וזמרת יה — stood against the prince of Egypt:"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:50.847042027Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}